{"1-11":{"people":[{"id":"meshelemiah-h4920","name":"Meshelemiah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Zechariah","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"ebiasaph-h0043","name":"Ebiasaph","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Korah","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"korah-h7141i","name":"Korah","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"kore-h6981g","name":"Kore","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ebiasaph","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"jathniel-h3496","name":"Jathniel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"jediael-h3043j","name":"Jediael","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"zebadiah-h2069j","name":"Zebadiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"zechariah-h2148a","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"A Singer","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"elam-h5867h","name":"Elam","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"eliehoenai-h0454a","name":"Eliehoenai","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"jehohanan-h3076i","name":"Jehohanan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Meshelemiah","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098i","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":3,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"obed-edom-h5654","name":"Obed-edom","kind":"person","brief":"A Singer","count":2,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"jehozabad-h3075h","name":"Jehozabad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"joah-h3098i","name":"Joah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"nethanel-h5417k","name":"Nethanel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"sachar-h7940g","name":"Sachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"ammiel-h5988i","name":"Ammiel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"issachar-h3485h","name":"Issachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"peullethai-h6469","name":"Peullethai","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Obed-edom","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"elihu-h0453i","name":"Elihu","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"elzabad-h0443h","name":"Elzabad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"obed-h5744j","name":"Obed","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"othni-h6273","name":"Othni","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"rephael-h7501","name":"Rephael","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"semachiah-h5565","name":"Semachiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shemaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"hosah-h2621h","name":"Hosah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Shimri","count":2,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"shimri-h8113i","name":"Shimri","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hosah","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"hilkiah-h2518j","name":"Hilkiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hosah","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"tebaliah-h2882","name":"Tebaliah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hosah","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zechariah-h2148f","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hosah","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H5654","lemma":"עֹבֵד אֱדוֹם","tr":"o·ved e·dom","gloss":"Obed-edom","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":40},{"base":"H4920","lemma":"מְשֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ","tr":"me·she·lem·yah","gloss":"Meshelemiah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":4},{"base":"H2428","lemma":"חַ֫יִל","tr":"cha·yil","gloss":"strength: soldiers","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":246},{"base":"H8098","lemma":"שְׁמַעְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"she·ma·yah","gloss":"Shemaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":41},{"base":"H7243","lemma":"רְבִיעִי","tr":"re·vi·i","gloss":"fourth","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":56},{"base":"H7992","lemma":"שְׁלִישִׁי","tr":"she·li·shi","gloss":"third","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":107},{"base":"H2621","lemma":"חֹסָה","tr":"cho·sah","gloss":"Hosah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":5},{"base":"H1060","lemma":"בְּכוֹר","tr":"be·khor","gloss":"firstborn","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":122},{"base":"H0251","lemma":"אָח","tr":"ach","gloss":"brother: male-sibling","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":629},{"base":"H8145","lemma":"שֵׁנִי","tr":"she·ni","gloss":"second","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":156}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":9,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and the sons of Eliab were Nemuel, Dathan, and Abiram. It was Dathan and Abiram, chosen by the congregation, who rebelled against Moses and Aaron with the followers of Korah who rebelled against the LORD. And the earth opened its mouth and swallowed them along with Korah, whose followers died when the fire consumed 250 men. They serve as a warning sign. However, the line of Korah did not die out.","from":1},{"book":"JDG","chapter":6,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the angel of the LORD appeared to Gideon and said, “The LORD is with you, O mighty man of valor.”","from":6},{"book":"2SA","chapter":2,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now then, be strong and courageous, for though Saul your lord is dead, the house of Judah has anointed me as their king.”","from":6},{"book":"1CH","chapter":5,"verse":1,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the sons of Reuben the firstborn of Israel. Though he was the firstborn, his birthright was given to the sons of Joseph son of Israel, because Reuben defiled his fatherʼs bed. So he is not reckoned according to birthright. And though Judah prevailed over his brothers and a ruler came from him, the birthright belonged to Joseph.","from":10},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":37,"verseEnd":37,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the son of Tahath, the son of Assir, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah,","from":1},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":17,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the gatekeepers: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their relatives. Shallum was their chief; he was previously stationed at the Kingʼs Gate on the east side. These were the gatekeepers from the camp of the Levites. Shallum son of Kore, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, and his relatives from the Korahites were assigned to guard the thresholds of the Tent, just as their fathers had been assigned to guard the entrance to the dwelling of the LORD. In earlier times Phinehas son of Eleazar had been in charge of the gatekeepers, and the LORD was with him. Zechariah son of Meshelemiah was the gatekeeper at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting.","from":1},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Shallum son of Kore, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, and his relatives from the Korahites were assigned to guard the thresholds of the Tent, just as their fathers had been assigned to guard the entrance to the dwelling of the LORD.","from":1},{"book":"1CH","chapter":12,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and Zadok, a mighty young man of valor, with 22 commanders from his own family.","from":6}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"12-19":{"people":[{"id":"meshelemiah-h4920","name":"Meshelemiah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Zechariah","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"zechariah-h2148a","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"A Singer","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"obed-edom-h5654","name":"Obed-edom","kind":"person","brief":"A Singer","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"hosah-h2621h","name":"Hosah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Shimri","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"shuppim-h8206h","name":"Shuppim","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"korah-h7141i","name":"Korah","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":19}],"places":[{"id":"shallecheth-h7996","name":"Shallecheth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"parbar-h6503","name":"Parbar","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":18}],"words":[{"base":"H1486","lemma":"גּוֹרָל","tr":"go·ral","gloss":"allotted","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":77},{"base":"H0624","lemma":"אָסֹף","tr":"a·suph","gloss":"storehouse","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H6503","lemma":"פַּרְוָר","tr":"par·bar","gloss":"colonnade","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H4628","lemma":"מַעֲרָב","tr":"ma·a·rav","gloss":"west","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":14},{"base":"H4929","lemma":"מִשְׁמָר","tr":"mish·mar","gloss":"custody","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":22},{"base":"H0702","lemma":"אַרְבַּע","tr":"ar·ba","gloss":"four","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":318},{"base":"H4546","lemma":"מְסִלָּה","tr":"me·sil·lah","gloss":"highway","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":27},{"base":"H8179","lemma":"שַׁ֫עַר","tr":"sha·ar","gloss":"gate","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":374},{"base":"H5980","lemma":"עֻמָּה","tr":"um·mah","gloss":"close","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":32},{"base":"H5307","lemma":"נָפַל","tr":"na·phal","gloss":"to fall: fall","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":434}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"As their brothers the descendants of Aaron did, they also cast lots in the presence of King David and of Zadok, Ahimelech, and the heads of the families of the priests and Levites—the family heads and their younger brothers alike.","from":13},{"book":"1CH","chapter":25,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"They cast lots for their duties, young and old alike, teacher as well as pupil.","from":13},{"book":"NUM","chapter":16,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Therefore, it is you and all your followers who have conspired against the LORD! As for Aaron, who is he that you should grumble against him?”","from":19},{"book":"1KI","chapter":10,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the food at his table, the seating of his servants, the service and attire of his attendants, his cupbearers, and the burnt offerings he presented at the house of the LORD, it took her breath away.","from":16},{"book":"2KI","chapter":23,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And he removed from the entrance to the house of the LORD the horses that the kings of Judah had dedicated to the sun. They were in the court near the chamber of an official named Nathan-melech. And Josiah burned up the chariots of the sun.","from":18},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The gatekeepers were stationed on the four sides: east, west, north, and south.","from":17},{"book":"1CH","chapter":25,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"They cast lots for their duties, young and old alike, teacher as well as pupil.","from":12},{"book":"1CH","chapter":25,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"They cast lots for their duties, young and old alike, teacher as well as pupil.","from":16}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"20-28":{"people":[{"id":"ahijah-h0281m","name":"Ahijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"jehiel-h3171h","name":"Jehiel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Libni","count":2,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"gershon-h1648","name":"Gershon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"libni-h3845g","name":"Libni","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gershon","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"joel-h3100o","name":"Joel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Libni","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"zetham-h2241","name":"Zetham","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Libni","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"amram-h6019g","name":"Amram","kind":"person","brief":"Moses' father","count":1,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"hebron-h2275b","name":"Hebron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":1,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"izhar-h3324","name":"Izhar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":1,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"uzziel-h5816g","name":"Uzziel","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's uncle","count":1,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"gershom-h1647g","name":"Gershom","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Moses","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"shebuel-h7619g","name":"Shebuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gershom","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"shelomoth-h8013h","name":"Shelomoth","kind":"person","brief":"Daughter of Zichri","count":3,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"eliezer-h0461h","name":"Eliezer","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Moses","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"isshiah-h3449j","name":"Isshiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Rehabiah","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"joram-h3141i","name":"Joram","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isshiah","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"rehabiah-h7345","name":"Rehabiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Eliezer","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"zichri-h2147l","name":"Zichri","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joram","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"abner-h0074","name":"Abner","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"joab-h3097g","name":"Joab","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"kish-h7027g","name":"Kish","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's father","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"ner-h5369g","name":"Ner","kind":"person","brief":"Abner's father","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"samuel-h8050g","name":"Samuel","kind":"person","brief":"Prophet and Judge","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"saul-h7586g","name":"Saul","kind":"person","brief":"King of Israel,","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"zeruiah-h6870g","name":"Zeruiah","kind":"person","brief":"Sister of David","count":1,"firstVerse":28}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H0214","lemma":"אוֹצָר","tr":"o·tsar","gloss":"treasure","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":79},{"base":"H3936","lemma":"לַעְדָּן","tr":"la·dan","gloss":"Ladan","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":7},{"base":"H6942","lemma":"קָדַשׁ","tr":"qa·dash","gloss":"to consecrate: consecate","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":171},{"base":"H3172","lemma":"יְחִיאֵלִי","tr":"ye·chi·e·li","gloss":"Jehieli","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H0251","lemma":"אָח","tr":"ach","gloss":"brother: male-sibling","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":629},{"base":"H8019","lemma":"שְׁלֹמִית","tr":"she·lo·mit","gloss":"Shelomith","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H1649","lemma":"גֵּרְשֻׁנִּי","tr":"ge·re·shun·ni","gloss":"Gershonite","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":13},{"base":"H2241","lemma":"זֵתָם","tr":"ze·tam","gloss":"Zetham","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H5817","lemma":"עׇזִּיאֵלִי","tr":"oz·zi·e·li","gloss":"Uzzielite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H6020","lemma":"עַמְרָמִי","tr":"am·ra·mi","gloss":"Amramite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"EXO","chapter":18,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The other son was named Eliezer, for Moses had said, “The God of my father was my helper and delivered me from the sword of Pharaoh.”","from":25},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath by their clans were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel.","from":23},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From Kohath came the clans of the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites, and the Uzzielites; these were the clans of the Kohathites.","from":23},{"book":"NUM","chapter":31,"verse":30,"verseEnd":52,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the Israelitesʼ half, take one out of every fifty, whether persons, cattle, donkeys, sheep, or other animals, and give them to the Levites who keep charge of the tabernacle of the LORD.” So Moses and Eleazar the priest did as the LORD had commanded Moses, and this plunder remained from the spoils the soldiers had taken: 675,000 sheep, 72,000 cattle, 61,000 donkeys,","from":26},{"book":"JOS","chapter":6,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"For all the silver and gold and all the articles of bronze and iron are holy to the LORD; they must go into His treasury.”","from":27},{"book":"1SA","chapter":9,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"(Formerly in Israel, a man on his way to inquire of God would say, “Come, let us go to the seer.” For the prophet of today was formerly called the seer.)","from":28},{"book":"1SA","chapter":14,"verse":47,"verseEnd":51,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"After Saul had assumed the kingship over Israel, he fought against all his enemies on every side—the Moabites, the Ammonites, the Edomites, the kings of Zobah, and the Philistines. Wherever he turned, he routed them. He fought valiantly and defeated the Amalekites, delivering Israel from the hands of its plunderers. Now the sons of Saul were Jonathan, Ishvi, and Malchishua. His two daughters were named Merab (his firstborn) and Michal (his younger daughter). His wifeʼs name was Ahinoam daughter of Ahimaaz. The name of the commander of his army was Abner, the son of Saulʼs uncle Ner. Saulʼs father Kish and Abnerʼs father Ner were sons of Abiel.","from":28},{"book":"1SA","chapter":17,"verse":55,"verseEnd":55,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"As Saul had watched David going out to confront the Philistine, he said to Abner the commander of the army, “Abner, whose son is this young man?” “As surely as you live, O king,” Abner replied, “I do not know.”","from":28}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":4},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3},{"id":"judges-era","title":"Judges era and the road to David","people":2}]},"29-32":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"chenaniah-h3663","name":"Chenaniah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"izhar-h3324","name":"Izhar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"hebron-h2275b","name":"Hebron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":2,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"hashabiah-h2811j","name":"Hashabiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":2,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"jerijah-h3404h","name":"Jerijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"manasseh-h4519g","name":"Manasseh","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"reuben-h7205","name":"Reuben","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":32}],"places":[{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"gilead-h1568g","name":"Gilead","kind":"place","brief":"In Manasseh","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"jazer-h3270g","name":"Jazer","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":31}],"words":[{"base":"H2276","lemma":"חֶבְרוֹנִי","tr":"chev·ro·ni","gloss":"Hebronite","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":6},{"base":"H2428","lemma":"חַ֫יִל","tr":"cha·yil","gloss":"strength: soldiers","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":246},{"base":"H4399","lemma":"מְלָאכָה","tr":"me·la·khah","gloss":"work","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":167},{"base":"H7651","lemma":"שֶׁ֫בַע","tr":"she·va","gloss":"seven","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":394},{"base":"H3404","lemma":"יְרִיָּהוּ","tr":"ye·riy·yah","gloss":"Jeriah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H3663","lemma":"כְּנַנְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"ke·nan·yah","gloss":"Chenaniah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H3325","lemma":"יִצְהָרִי","tr":"yits·ha·ri","gloss":"Izharite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H4520","lemma":"מְנַשִּׁי","tr":"me·nash·shi","gloss":"Manassite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H0505","lemma":"אֶ֫לֶף","tr":"e·leph","gloss":"thousand","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":506},{"base":"H3967","lemma":"מֵאָה","tr":"me·ah","gloss":"hundred","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":581}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"“Of these,” said David, “24,000 are to oversee the work of the house of the LORD, 6,000 are to be officers and judges,","from":29},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The sons of Hebron: Jeriah was the first, Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, and Jekameam the fourth.","from":31},{"book":"NEH","chapter":11,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Shabbethai and Jozabad, two leaders of the Levites, who supervised the work outside the house of God;","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":39,"verseEnd":39,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Heshbon, and Jazer—four cities in all, together with their pasturelands.","from":31},{"book":"1KI","chapter":2,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The length of Davidʼs reign over Israel was forty years—seven years in Hebron and thirty-three years in Jerusalem.","from":31},{"book":"1CH","chapter":12,"verse":37,"verseEnd":37,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And from east of the Jordan, from Reuben, Gad, and the half-tribe of Manasseh there: 120,000 armed with every kind of weapon of war.","from":32},{"book":"1CH","chapter":15,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And he said to them, “You are the heads of the Levitical families. You and your relatives must consecrate yourselves so that you may bring the ark of the LORD, the God of Israel, to the place I have prepared for it.","from":32},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel—four in all.","from":29}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]}}